{"id":"expectativa","lemma":"expectativa","pos":"noun","rank":3613,"glosses":["expectation (that which is expected or looked for)"],"ipa":"/is.pek.taˈt͡ʃi.vɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"expectativas"},"examples":[{"text":"Eu não tinha nenhuma expectativa.","en":"I didn't have any expectations.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"not any, none","l":"nenhum"},null]},{"text":"Eu sei quais são as expectativas.","en":"I know what's expected.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be aware, to know","l":"saber"},{"g":"which","l":"qual"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"O resultado superou as minhas expectativas.","en":"The result exceeded my expectations.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"result"},{"g":"to exceed","l":"superar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"meu"},null]},{"text":"Tom aguardou com expectativa.","en":"Tom waited expectantly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/535623","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to await","l":"aguardar"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Tom sabe quais são as suas expectativas?","en":"Does Tom know what your expectations are?","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to be aware, to know","l":"saber"},{"g":"which","l":"qual"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"his","l":"seu"},null]}]}